tools/measure_frame_cost.gd, headless Godot 4.5.2, Linux x86_64 VM (2 cores), 240 simulated 60 Hz frames per level.
"view update" is the GDScript cost of World3D._update_view (road, terrain, scenery, grass, camera). GPU rendering is not included.
v0.16.0 code = the handoff source with only the optional-media loader added, so it runs without the media pack.

